WEBVTT

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.527
Two summers ago, she announced
the amicable ending of her marriage

00:02:00.551 --> 00:02:03.411
and a new relationship
with her best friend,

00:02:03.435 --> 00:02:05.865
the writer Rayya Elias,

00:02:05.889 --> 00:02:09.551
who had been diagnosed
with terminal cancer.

00:02:10.321 --> 00:02:13.110
Rayya passed away in January of this year.

00:02:14.017 --> 00:02:17.744
Liz, that fact makes it
all the more astonishing

00:02:17.768 --> 00:02:20.764
that you're willing to come now
and spend time with me.

00:02:20.788 --> 00:02:21.977
Welcome.

00:02:22.001 --> 00:02:24.800
Elizabeth Gilbert: I'm so happy
to be here with you, Chris.

00:02:24.824 --> 00:02:25.984
Thank you so much.

00:02:26.008 --> 00:02:28.480
You always invite me to things
and I always say yes,

00:02:28.504 --> 00:02:30.866
because I always know
it's going to be good.